&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is seeking a Corporate Development Sourcing Lead to drive the front-end of our strategic transactions practice, focused on identifying, sourcing, and evaluating acquisition targets, strategic investments, and partnership opportunities. In this role, you will work closely with senior members of Anthropic’s Corporate Development and leadership teams to build a rigorous pipeline of opportunities aligned with our strategic priorities, and develop the analytical frameworks that inform our most important growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings strong analytical skills, intellectual curiosity, and a genuine passion for the AI landscape. You’re excited about Anthropic’s mission to develop AI that is safe and beneficial, and you want to help us identify the partnerships, acquisitions, and investments that will accelerate that mission. You thrive in ambiguous environments and can synthesize complex information to surface clear strategic insights across Anthropic’s diverse business areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in shaping the future of AI while ensuring it remains safe and beneficial for humanity. This role offers a unique vantage point at the intersection of cutting-edge AI research and strategic business development — with the opportunity to build deep pattern recognition across the ecosystem and meaningfully influence Anthropic’s growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
